  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot. Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-9c1f3812.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, corn and carrot, tossing, until lightly browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are 'popping' out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-82787543.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook gnocchi, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi is sticking to the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-c2eb65d1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot. Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Add Mexican Fiesta spice blend to the pan. Cook, tossing, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Return cooked veggies to the pan, then add the water, salt, brown sugar, butter and diced tomatoes with garlic & onion. Stir to combine, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-12e12669.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer gnocchi to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until cheese is melted and golden, 5-10 minutes. TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the gnocchi!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-c6483831.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican-spiced grilled gnocchi between bowls.\n• Top with light sour cream.\n• Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627dca8fe2b8dc5d480f958a/step-3117e7eb.jpg"
    }
  ]
